    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746240/extras/499f1e358f0b333117afcaf617c8a0f1.avif?t=1747699459\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refraction</strong> is a third-person, narrative-driven psychological horror game where you're caught in a loop you don't understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange, abandoned warehouse. In one of the rooms, you witness a murder; and the victim looks a lot like you. Before you can react, everything resets. The scene plays out again, and again, each time slightly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shifting environment, uncover hidden clues, and face the subtle horrors that reveal themselves with each loop. Some loops feel familiar. Others\u2026 wrong. But no matter what, the cycle won\u2019t stop until you figure out why it's happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many loops will it take to find a way out?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746240/extras/499f1e358f0b333117afcaf617c8a0f1.avif?t=1747699459\" data-has-big width=800 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refraction</strong> is a third-person, narrative-driven psychological horror game where you're caught in a loop you don't understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a strange, abandoned warehouse. In one of the rooms, you witness a murder; and the victim looks a lot like you. Before you can react, everything resets. The scene plays out again, and again, each time slightly different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shifting environment, uncover hidden clues, and face the subtle horrors that reveal themselves with each loop. Some loops feel familiar. Others\u2026 wrong. But no matter what, the cycle won\u2019t stop until you figure out why it's happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many loops will it take to find a way out?</p>",
    "short_description": "Refraction is a third-person psychological horror experience where you awaken in a strange room, only to find yourself trapped in a haunting time loop, forced to witness a brutal murder replay itself over and over again.",
